_HALF_EVEN`). This made `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` fail on the nightly build.\n\n## Change\n- Switch the rounding mode from `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in `src/money.py`.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n\nNeeded for today's release since the nightly build is currently red.", "reviewers": ["code-owner"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.75}, "confidence": 0.75}, {"t_ms": 403066, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01ATCy1mQM5eeyvqkCWcTFzJ", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 403066, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01ATCy1mQM5eeyvqkCWcTFzJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 405122, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LH8wrmzBd6JYDGY9ukiex9", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.8}, "confidence": 0.8}, {"t_ms": 405422, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LH8wrmzBd6JYDGY9ukiex9", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 405422, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LH8wrmzBd6JYDGY9ukiex9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 407021, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01F2pUn2SJFKey9v4XtzWUDX", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["code-owner"], "confidence": 0.7}, "confidence": 0.7}, {"t_ms": 407321, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01F2pUn2SJFKey9v4XtzWUDX", "tool": "request